{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27421","headline":"崔卿双白鹭 · 顾非熊","name":"崔卿双白鹭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝客高清爱水禽，绿波双鹭在园林。\n立当风里丝摇急，步遶池边字印深。\n刷羽竞生堪画势，依泉各有取鱼心。\n我乡多傍门前见，坐觉烟波思不禁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾非熊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27421.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27421","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}